      "faq": {
        "eyebrow": "PRICING FAQ",
        "title": "Questions we actually",
        "titleHighlight": "get asked.",
        "subtitle": "If yours isn't listed, we reply within 4 business hours.",
        "ctaLabel": "Ask a question",
        "items": [
          {
            "q": "Is the Starter plan really free?",
            "a": "Yes, free forever: up to 2 boats, 1 user, unlimited history. No credit card, no deadline. You can move to Pro or Enterprise any time from your settings, and back to Starter without losing your data."
          },
          {
            "q": "How do I pay for boats?",
            "a": "You pay a flat fee per plan, regardless of the exact number of boats within the range. Beyond the 8 boats included in Pro, you add extra boats at €4/boat/month, or move to Enterprise (unlimited boats) — no cutoff, no surprise overage."
          },
          {
            "q": "Is there a commitment?",
            "a": "No. Monthly or annual, you can cancel any time in 1 click from your account. Annual simply offers −20% in exchange for a yearly commitment."
          },
          {
            "q": "What about VAT?",
            "a": "Prices shown are excluding tax. VAT (20% for French B2C customers, exempt for EU B2B with a valid VAT number) is applied at billing."
          },
          {
            "q": "What happens if I cancel?",
            "a": "You keep access until the end of the paid period. Then you move to the free Starter plan for 90 days to export your data."
          },
          {
            "q": "Which payment methods do you accept?",
            "a": "Credit card (Visa, Mastercard, AmEx), SEPA direct debit, bank transfer (annual only). Secure Stripe billing."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can I test FleetAi on the Starter plan?",
            "a": "The full FleetAi AI (copilot, contextual suggestions, conversational scheduling) is reserved for the Pro and Enterprise plans. The Starter plan stays free for fleet tracking, maintenance and history, and includes 2 AI breakdown diagnoses — upgrade to Pro any time to unlock the rest."
          },
          {
            "q": "Do you offer student / non-profit pricing?",
            "a": "Yes — 50% discount for non-profit schools and sports associations. Contact us with your registration number."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can I try the AI without an account?",
            "a": "Yes. The engine breakdown diagnosis is open to everyone from the site: you describe the fault, the assistant asks a few questions, then points you to the likely causes, from the cheapest to the most expensive to check. It is free and account-free, up to 2 diagnoses — the Pro and Enterprise plans have no conversation cap at all, only their monthly AI token quota."
          }
        ]
